---
// Minimal page whose markup gives the utility-class scanner real candidates
// to pick up: `p-4`/`rounded` (scale/literal namespaces), `bg-primary-500`
// (color namespace), `open:bg-primary-600` (variant), plus a shadcn-bridge
// variable name (`bg-card`/`text-card-foreground`) that is NOT part of luz's
// closed utility vocabulary — it's expected to be dropped by the scanner
// while still being backed by the `--card`/`--card-foreground` aliases the
// shadcn bridge emits unconditionally.
---
<html lang="en">
  <body>
    <div class="p-4 bg-primary-500 rounded open:bg-primary-600">
      <p class="bg-card text-card-foreground">shadcn-bridged surface</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
